    >[ ] Generate every arrived Habit slot in resumable batches =core-habit-catchup $One small reviewed increment; worker and independent reviewer from different vendors under dispatch. Add named tests before implementation, prove they execute (not a zero-test filtered pass), and pass clearhead-core/scripts/gate.sh before landing. Replace the single-live token with write-path native Habit catch-up. Reads remain pure; completing Habit stops generation, not existing Actions. Acceptance: habit_catchup tests several missed slots while older ones remain open, tiny batch budget, interrupted writes/restart and idempotent retry; eventual union equals every arrived nonexcluded slot exactly once. Report pending backlog; never drop it due to a cap.$ !2 ^2026-10-26T05:15 <core-habit-steps #01a176a3-0d68-7452-8252-1c5ca5398a9e
